Explanation
Code                | Purpose
--------------------|------------------------------------
fruits.map(...)     | Processes each fruit
fruit               | Current fruit
index               | Current array position
key={index}         | Uses position as key
{fruit}             | Displays current fruit


key={index} can be acceptable for a truly static list whose items are not inserted, removed, or reordered. A stable ID is preferable for dynamic lists.

