ARRAY METHODS - QUICK COMPARISON

================================================================================

Method     | Purpose                    | Typical Result
-----------|----------------------------|-----------------------------
map()      | Transform every item       | New array
filter()   | Keep matching items        | New filtered array
find()     | Find first matching item   | One item / undefined
forEach()  | Perform operation per item | undefined

React Example: filter() + map()
{books
  .filter(book => book.inStock)
  .map(book => (

    <Book
      key={book.id}
      book={book}
    />

  ))}


